  "notes": "## 0.13.1 - 2026-06-04\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix excessive disk usage on Linux, where copying a single image could flood the clipboard cache with hundreds of near-duplicate captures, and re-copying existing content now reuses the existing history entry instead of piling up duplicates (#957)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.13.1 - 2026-06-04\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 Linux 上磁盘占用过大的问题：此前复制单张图片可能在剪贴板缓存中产生数百份近似重复的副本；同时，再次复制已有内容现在会复用历史中已存在的条目，而不再堆积重复项 (#957)",
